This bears saying plainly for a diving application: Yemoja is a logbook and an aid to
understanding dives already made. It is not dive planning software, it is not a dive
computer, and it has been certified as neither. Any decompression figure it shows is
one model's estimate of a past dive. Diving is dangerous, and responsibility for your
